<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PhyCor raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PhyCor raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>- McDonald &amp; Co said on Thursday it raised PhyCor Inc to aggressive buy from hold.</p>
<p>- Analyst Stephen DeNelsky said in a report that the physician practice management firm's solid management and consistent growth make the company a &quot;standout&quot; in its sector.</p>
<p>- In addition, the sector has experienced a recent price pullback, he said.</p>
<p>- The stock was up 3/4 to 29-1/4 on Nasdaq.</p>
<p>- He set a 12- to 18-month price target of $40 and estimated the company will earn $0.59 for 1996 and $0.82 for 1997 versus $0.41 for 1995.</p>
<p>((Cleveland Newsdesk, Susan Zimmerman 216-579-0077))</p>
